{
  "_doc": "Source-of-truth input for scripts/generate-seo-pages.py. Operator edits the cities + roles arrays then re-runs the script to regenerate deploy/seo-pages.json.example. Cross-product = pages = cities × roles. Slugs must be alnum or dash; labels are free text. The intro_template uses {role} and {city} placeholders.",
